    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you give me a quick summary of the whole debate over school vouchers? Like, what are the main reasons people think they're good for kids, and why do so many people just hate them?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "School vouchers are generally praised for promoting school choice, potentially increasing competition among schools, enhancing education quality, and encouraging innovation. Opponents argue that they divert public funding from public schools, exacerbate inequality, and weaken public education systems. Critics also express concern that vouchers may not provide a seamless transition to private schools due to numerous entry barriers like curriculum and additional costs. The debate continues, with both sides presenting valid arguments based on differing perspectives on education policy and equity.",
      "source": "target",
